## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00

> *"I measured first. Meals list was already under budget when warm, so I didn't put it in Redis. I did cache daily stats for sixty seconds and invalidate on write. Caching without invalidation is how you ship lies to users."*

**5 từ:** `under budget` · `invalidate on write` · `ETag` · `304` · `ship lies`

